
NTeX Release 1.2 --- ntb-xfig 1.1 --- status: optional

This package contains the binaries for xfig, an interactive drawing tool
under X. xfig can create fig, epsf and LaTeX files with various options.
You also have to install ntb-traf so that xfig can export fig files as
epsf and LaTeX files. This package also contains a set of basic examples
of fig files (see /usr/lib/texmf/xfig/examples).

